  "title": "Voya Investment Management launches new multi-manager alternative CITs",
  "summary": "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- Voya Investment Management (Voya IM), the asset management business of Voya Financial, Inc. (NYSE: VOYA) today announced the launch of its new multi manager series of collective investment trusts (“CITs”) designed for defined contribution (“DC”) retirement plans. V-ALT Multi-Manager Alternative Fixed Income and V-ALT Multi-Manager Alternative Equity will initially be available through advisor managed accounts on Voya’s Retirement platform. Global Trust Company (GTC) is the Trustee for the V-ALT CITs.",
